WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.337
Hi, I'm Luís.

00:00:01.509 --> 00:00:03.848
Welcome to Go Programming with GoLand,

00:00:04.121 --> 00:00:07.214
where you'll go from Go basics to a small web service.

00:00:07.506 --> 00:00:08.591
And this is Nikolas.

00:00:08.877 --> 00:00:11.470
He'll teach you slices, maps and structs,

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.213
and goroutines and channels.
